pi-openviking

This package contains an unchanged copy of the OpenViking shared credential
resolver in vendor/credentials.mjs. Its source is the Uni-Viking/OpenViking
example Pi extension, source/examples/pi-coding-agent-extension/shared/credentials.mjs,
from Uni-Viking commit 4d394a0. The examples are licensed under Apache-2.0.
The corresponding Apache-2.0 license is included in LICENSE.

The package adds Pi-native MCP registration, named connection management,
setup dialogs, a CLI, and credential-redacted health diagnostics. It does not bundle or modify the OpenViking
server, Pi's MCP transport, or the separate OpenViking memory extension.
